current position is slightly underwater, but the long-term growth trajectory and product roadmap (Vera Rubin) support maintaining the position for a 6-12 month horizon.\n\n    *   Confidence: 0.85 (Strong fundamentals, but acknowledging the \"AI Selloff\" sentiment).\n\n    *   Wait, should I BUY more? The prompt says \"only if you do not already hold one\". I already hold one.\n    *   Should I SELL? The price is down slightly, but the fundamentals are still elite. Selling now would lock in a loss on a high-growth leader.\n    *   Decision: HOLD.", "finish_reason": "stop"}',211823,NULL,'2026-07-17T20:40:54+00:00');
