 months.\n\n    *   Signal: HOLD\n    *   Confidence: 0.85\n    *   Reasoning: Strong fundamentals including 33.1% revenue growth and a 32.9% ROE justify maintaining the position despite the current price being below the SMA200. The attractive forward P/E of 16.38 and recovery from a 20% drawdown suggest a solid long-term outlook ahead of the July 29 earnings report.", "finish_reason": "stop"}',201472,NULL,'2026-07-23T20:57:15+00:00');
