y with very strong growth and a reasonable forward P/E.\n\n    *   Signal: HOLD\n    *   Confidence: 0.85\n    *   Reasoning: While the price is currently below the SMA50 and SMA200, the strong fundamentals\u2014specifically the 33.1% revenue growth and a low forward P/E of 16.08\u2014support a long-term bullish thesis. The \"Magnificent 7\" reward narrative provides a structural tailwind that outweighs the current short-term technical pullback.\n\n    *   JSON only? Yes.\n    *   One action? Yes.\n    *   6-12 month horizon? Yes.\n    *   Reasoning 2-4 sentences? Yes.", "finish_reason": "stop"}',202591,NULL,'2026-07-24T21:09:49+00:00');
