ing below its 50-day and 200-day moving averages with a 3-month decline, the strong ROE of 24.1% and market share gains from competitors like Kroger provide a solid defensive foundation. The current price is near the cost basis, making it prudent to hold through the current volatility until a clearer trend reversal occurs.", "finish_reason": "stop"}',192319,NULL,'2026-07-28T21:24:19+00:00');
