ction: HOLD.\n    *   Reasoning: Strong fundamentals (34% ROE, 18.3% revenue growth) and AI/Cloud leadership provide a solid long-term thesis despite the current price being below the SMA50 and SMA200. The forward P/E of 20.15 is attractive, and the recent Q4 beat supports a hold position through current market volatility.\n\n    *   Signal: HOLD\n    *   Confidence: 0.85 (High confidence in the company''s quality, moderate confidence in the timing of the recovery).", "finish_reason": "stop"}',218576,NULL,'2026-07-29T20:40:18+00:00');
