.75\n    *   Reasoning: While the stock is trading below its SMA50 and SMA200 with recent negative sentiment from an earnings miss, the forward P/E of 15.82 and 33.1% revenue growth suggest strong underlying fundamentals. The current position is underwater, and the mixed headlines regarding AI and macro uncertainty warrant a patient approach until a clearer trend reversal occurs.", "finish_reason": "stop"}',178352,NULL,'2026-07-29T20:54:09+00:00');
