gical move to see the earnings results.\n\n    *   Signal: HOLD\n    *   Confidence: 0.85\n    *   Reasoning: While the stock is currently trading below its SMA50 and has seen a significant 1-month decline, the strong ROE of 51.3% and 22.2% revenue growth support a long-term bullish thesis. The significant compression from trailing P/E (40.60) to forward P/E (26.76) suggests a positive outlook for upcoming earnings, making a \"HOLD\" appropriate while awaiting Q2 results.", "finish_reason": "stop"}',198958,NULL,'2026-07-31T22:04:26+00:00');
