rowth provide a reason to stay in the position for the 6-12 month horizon to see if the recovery plays out.\n\n    *   Signal: HOLD\n    *   Confidence: 0.65 (Moderate, due to high debt/leverage vs. recovery momentum).\n    *   Reasoning: While the debt-to-equity ratio is extremely high and the P/E remains elevated, the accelerating delivery pace and $24.6B revenue growth suggest a recovery in momentum. The current position is in profit, and the neutral RSI indicates a period of consolidation before a potential trend shift.", "finish_reason": "stop"}',208176,NULL,'2026-07-31T22:07:54+00:00');
